  "Command: curl -sfk -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8096/skill-bridge/v3/skill/search -d '{\"query\":\"x\"}'\n"
  + 'Stdout: {"code":0,"data":{"items":[]}}\n'
  + `Stderr: ${stderr}\n`
  + `Exit Code: ${exit}\n`
  + "Signal: (none)";

